    storyEnglish: "When the teacher returned the students' assignments, Omar immediately noticed an obvious mistake in his work. He had copied one number incorrectly, which caused the final answer to be wrong. He felt embarrassed at first because the mistake was so easy to see, but the teacher reminded him that mistakes were part of learning. Omar corrected the number and understood the problem much better afterward.",
